{"seq":1,"slug":"migration-strategy-patterns","title":"数据库迁移策略与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/migration-strategy-patterns","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据库迁移策略与模式\">数据库迁移策略与模式</h1><p>数据库迁移是工程中最高风险的操作之一——它不仅涉及数据搬运，还牵涉 schema 转换、应用改造、性能验证和切换时的业务连续性。一次失败的迁移可能导致数小时的停机和数据不一致。本文建立一套系统化的迁移方法论，覆盖从评估到切换的完整生命周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据库迁移方法论的三个关键维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四种迁移模式</strong>：直接转储（Big Bang）、CDC 流式复制、双写+影子读、绞杀者模式——按停机容忍度和 schema 变更程度选择</li>\n<li><strong>数据验证三层法</strong>：计数验证 → 抽样验证 → 校验和验证——迁移不可信，验证才可信</li>\n<li><strong>切换与回退</strong>：DNS/连接串/代理层三种切换策略各有风险-复杂度权衡，回退计划必须预演练</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"迁移动机分类\">迁移动机分类</h2><p>数据库迁移的触发因素决定了策略选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动机类型</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>时间压力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本优化</td>\n<td>Oracle → PostgreSQL 降低许可费</td>\n<td>高（功能差异）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展瓶颈</td>\n<td>单实例 MySQL → Aurora / 分布式 SQL</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云迁移</td>\n<td>自建 PG → RDS / Cloud SQL</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型不匹配</td>\n<td>关系型 → 文档/时序/图</td>\n<td>高（重新建模）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规要求</td>\n<td>跨境数据驻留 → 本地化部署</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高（监管 deadline）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品停服</td>\n<td>PlanetScale 取消免费层 → 替代方案</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四种迁移模式\">四种迁移模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[迁移决策] --&gt; B{可接受停机?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{数据量}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[在线迁移]&#10;    C --&gt;|&lt; 100GB| E[直接转储]&#10;    C --&gt;|&gt; 100GB| F[并行导出]&#10;    D --&gt; G{schema 变更?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[双写 + 影子读]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[CDC 流式复制]\">graph TD\n    A[迁移决策] --&gt; B{可接受停机?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{数据量}\n    B --&gt;|否| D[在线迁移]\n    C --&gt;|&lt; 100GB| E[直接转储]\n    C --&gt;|&gt; 100GB| F[并行导出]\n    D --&gt; G{schema 变更?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[双写 + 影子读]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[CDC 流式复制]</pre><h3 id=\"模式一-直接转储-big-bang\">模式一：直接转储（Big Bang）</h3><p>适用条件：数据量 &lt; 100 GB、可接受 1-4 小时停机窗口。</p>\n<p>执行流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>停止应用写入</li>\n<li><code>pg_dump</code> / <code>mysqldump</code> 导出</li>\n<li>目标库导入 + 索引重建</li>\n<li>验证数据完整性（行数、校验和）</li>\n<li>切换应用连接串</li>\n<li>恢复服务</li>\n</ol>\n<p>风险点：导入时间可能超预期（索引构建占 60-80% 的导入时间）。缓解方式：先导入数据，再异步构建索引。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-cdc-流式复制\">模式二：CDC 流式复制</h3><p>适用条件：零停机要求、schema 兼容、源库支持 CDC（Change Data Capture）。</p>\n<p>核心工具链：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>源库</th>\n<th>目标库</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MySQL → Aurora/RDS</td>\n<td>AWS DMS</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL → AlloyDB</td>\n<td>Google Datastream</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oracle → PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>AWS SCT + DMS</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MongoDB → DocumentDB</td>\n<td>AWS DMS</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任意 → 任意</td>\n<td>Debezium + Kafka Connect</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CDC 迁移的延迟公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{replication} = \\delta_{capture} + \\delta_{transport} + \\delta_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{capture}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是源库 WAL/binlog 的读取延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{transport}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是网络传输延迟，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标库的事务应用延迟。目标是在切换前使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{replication} &lt; 1\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-双写-影子读-shadow-traffic\">模式三：双写 + 影子读（Shadow Traffic）</h3><p>适用条件：schema 变更导致无法直接 CDC、需要逐步验证正确性。</p>\n<p>架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    App[应用] --&gt;|主写| Old[旧数据库]&#10;    App --&gt;|副写| New[新数据库]&#10;    App --&gt;|主读| Old&#10;    App -.-&gt;|影子读 + 对比| New&#10;    Compare[对比服务] --&gt;|差异报告| Alert[告警]\">graph LR\n    App[应用] --&gt;|主写| Old[旧数据库]\n    App --&gt;|副写| New[新数据库]\n    App --&gt;|主读| Old\n    App -.-&gt;|影子读 + 对比| New\n    Compare[对比服务] --&gt;|差异报告| Alert[告警]</pre><p>关键实现细节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>副写必须异步（不影响主路径延迟）</li>\n<li>影子读的结果不返回给用户，只用于对比</li>\n<li>差异超过阈值时告警但不阻断</li>\n<li>对比逻辑需要处理时间窗口内的最终一致性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"模式四-strangler-fig-绞杀者模式\">模式四：Strangler Fig（绞杀者模式）</h3><p>适用条件：从关系型迁移到完全不同的数据模型（如微服务拆分后迁移到多种专用库）。</p>\n<p>命名来源于雨林中的绞杀榕——新系统逐渐包裹旧系统直到完全替代。执行步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在旧系统前放置一个路由层（API Gateway 或代理）</li>\n<li>新功能直接写入新数据库</li>\n<li>已有功能逐个迁移：先双读验证，确认无误后切换读源</li>\n<li>当所有读请求都来自新库后，停止向旧库写入</li>\n<li>保留旧库只读一段时间作为回退保险</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"迁移中的数据验证\">迁移中的数据验证</h2><p>数据验证是迁移中最容易被低估的环节。三层验证框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证层</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>验证内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计数验证</td>\n<td><code>SELECT COUNT(*)</code> 两端对比</td>\n<td>行数一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽样验证</td>\n<td>随机采样 1% 记录，逐字段对比</td>\n<td>字段级正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验和验证</td>\n<td>全表 CRC32/MD5</td>\n<td>比特级完整性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于大表（&gt; 1 亿行），全量校验和代价过高。采用分块校验策略：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>checksum</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>where </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{checksum}_{table} = \\bigoplus_{i=1}^{N} \\text{hash}(chunk_i) \\quad \\text{where } chunk_i = rows[i \\cdot B : (i+1) \\cdot B]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">checksum</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨁</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">where </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分块大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 10000-100000 行，可并行计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"切换策略与回退计划\">切换策略与回退计划</h2><p>数据库切换的瞬间是风险最集中的时刻。三种切换策略的风险-复杂度权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>停机时间</th>\n<th>回退难度</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DNS 切换</td>\n<td>TTL 时间（60-300s）</td>\n<td>回切 DNS 即可</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接串切换</td>\n<td>应用重启时间</td>\n<td>回切配置重启</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理层切换</td>\n<td>0（热切换）</td>\n<td>路由回退</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论选择哪种策略，<strong>回退计划必须在切换前经过演练</strong>。回退窗口（在新库积累不可逆数据之前的安全回退时间）决定了你有多少时间来发现问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{rollback\\_window} = \\min(T_{first\\_irreversible\\_write}, T_{acceptable\\_data\\_loss})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oss</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>建议回退窗口不少于 24 小时——这意味着切换后的 24 小时内，旧库的 CDC 管道仍需保持运行以支持反向同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移项目管理\">迁移项目管理</h2><p>一个中等规模的迁移项目（100 GB 级、零停机）通常需要 8-12 周：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时长</th>\n<th>产出物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评估</td>\n<td>1-2 周</td>\n<td>兼容性报告、工作量估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概念验证</td>\n<td>2-3 周</td>\n<td>性能基准、成本模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 迁移</td>\n<td>1-2 周</td>\n<td>DDL 脚本、数据类型映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据同步</td>\n<td>2-3 周</td>\n<td>CDC 管道 + 验证框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用改造</td>\n<td>2-4 周（并行）</td>\n<td>连接层 + 查询改写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换演练</td>\n<td>1 周</td>\n<td>runbook + 回退验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式切换</td>\n<td>1 天</td>\n<td>完成迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>迁移完成后，多库并存的场景需要持续治理——参见 <a href=\"multi-database-polyglot\">多数据库混用架构</a>。迁移后的新系统需要建立监控基线——参见 <a href=\"dbaas-monitoring-tuning\">DBaaS 监控与调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据库迁移的成功率取决于三个因素：正确的模式选择（匹配停机容忍度和复杂度预算）、充分的数据验证（三层验证框架不可缩减）、以及经过演练的回退计划（回退窗口至少 24 小时）。CDC 流式复制是 2026 年零停机迁移的主流模式，但它要求源库支持 CDC 且 schema 兼容——不满足时需退到双写或绞杀者模式。迁移项目的最大风险不是技术失败，而是低估时间和对「回退不可能」的情况缺乏预案。把迁移当作一个 8-12 周的正式项目来管理，而非一个周末的 DBA 任务。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据库迁移策略与模式","id":"数据库迁移策略与模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移动机分类","id":"迁移动机分类"},{"level":2,"text":"四种迁移模式","id":"四种迁移模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：直接转储（Big Bang）","id":"模式一-直接转储-big-bang"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：CDC 流式复制","id":"模式二-cdc-流式复制"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：双写 + 影子读（Shadow Traffic）","id":"模式三-双写-影子读-shadow-traffic"},{"level":3,"text":"模式四：Strangler Fig（绞杀者模式）","id":"模式四-strangler-fig-绞杀者模式"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移中的数据验证","id":"迁移中的数据验证"},{"level":2,"text":"切换策略与回退计划","id":"切换策略与回退计划"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移项目管理","id":"迁移项目管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图数据库与向量数据库选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/nosql-specialized/graph-vector-databases"},"next":{"title":"多数据库混用架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-database-selection-patterns/operations-migration/multi-database-polyglot"}}